      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "H3 STUDIO v2 - no new base models, no BF16 upgrade, no prompt enhancer.\n\nAuto: zero media = Generate; one photo = Edit; video or multiple photos = References.\nSelect References explicitly to make a NEW image from one photo. Upload a video or leave (none).\nVideo is trimmed, normalized to 24 fps and aligned to the H3 frame grid. Audio is ignored. Output is ONE PNG.\nQuality: 50 steps. REF2VA Turbo: 8 steps for References/Replace person. Developer FL2VA fast: Generate/Edit only.\nThe existing REF2VA Turbo adapter is reused; if absent the new image downloads it once (1.96 GB).\nPicture tags follow active photo-slot order. Video is always <Video 1>. Start with a short clip and 1-2 photos.\nLegacy v1 workflows remain intact. No AI Lab color node or SAM is required.\n\nPERSON REPLACEMENT: Image 1 is the existing target photograph. Slots 2-9 / optional video define the replacement.\nRight-click target Load Image > Open in MaskEditor. Paint the WHOLE original person (white = replace), then save.\nprotect_background ON requires that mask, resizes the generated candidate to the original canvas and composites it.\nUnmasked original pixels stay unchanged. The mask does NOT guide H3 sampling; a drifting pose can need a wider mask or another seed.\nFor whole-image regeneration without painting, switch protect_background OFF. Background preservation is then not guaranteed.\nDefault prompt uses image 1 as the target and all other active references as replacement identity. Add more specific roles only when needed."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "H3 STUDIO v2 - no new base models, no BF16 upgrade, no prompt enhancer.\n\nAuto: zero media = Generate; one photo = Edit; video or multiple photos = References.\nSelect References explicitly to make a NEW image from one photo. Upload a video or leave (none).\nVideo is trimmed, normalized to 24 fps and aligned to the H3 frame grid. Audio is ignored. Output is ONE PNG.\nQuality: 50 steps. REF2VA Turbo: 8 steps for References/Replace person. Developer FL2VA fast: Generate/Edit only.\nThe existing REF2VA Turbo adapter is reused; if absent the new image downloads it once (1.96 GB).\nPicture tags follow active photo-slot order. Video is always <Video 1>. Start with a short clip and 1-2 photos.\nLegacy v1 workflows remain intact. No AI Lab color node or SAM is required.\n\nPERSON REPLACEMENT: Image 1 is the existing target photograph. Slots 2-9 / optional video define the replacement.\nRight-click target Load Image > Open in MaskEditor. Paint the WHOLE original person (white = replace), then save.\nprotect_background ON requires that mask, resizes the generated candidate to the original canvas and composites it.\nUnmasked original pixels stay unchanged. The mask does NOT guide H3 sampling; a drifting pose can need a wider mask or another seed.\nFor whole-image regeneration without painting, switch protect_background OFF. Background preservation is then not guaranteed.\nDefault prompt uses image 1 as the target and all other active references as replacement identity. Add more specific roles only when needed."
      }
    }
